1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kissasia.net =

2
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,940
♪ Her smile, her kindness, her kiss ♪

3
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,820
♪ Her presumptions ♪

4
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,276
♪ She was in love, she was tired, she walked away ♪

5
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,660
♪ Only tears remained ♪

6
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,180
♪ Can't hold on, can't forget ♪

7
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,500
♪ Can't let go of her all-or-nothing love ♪

8
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:44,100
♪ Promises became a burden after all that hesitation ♪

9
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,500
♪ Leaving longing frozen into a winter night ♪

10
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:53,420
♪ That girl, my girl ♪

11
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:57,540
♪ The light's still on, but you're already far away ♪

12
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:01,020
♪ The words reach my lips, but I can't get them out ♪

13
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:06,740
♪ That girl, my girl ♪

14
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,860
♪ My voice echoes, but no one answers ♪

15
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,340
♪ Is this really how it ends for us? ♪

16
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:33,980
[You don't have to be perfect to be worthy of Love]

17
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:35,356
[The Early Spring]

18
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:38,140
[Adapted from The Early Spring on jjwxc.net, Author: Gu Niang Bie Ku]

19
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,760
Not bad.

20
00:01:40,950 --> 00:01:41,286
Show me.

21
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:42,047
Have a look.

22
00:01:42,071 --> 00:01:43,310
Okay. Let's see.

23
00:01:45,510 --> 00:01:46,790
These photos turned out so well.

24
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,840
Don't you think so?

25
00:01:48,490 --> 00:01:50,480
Thank you for being with me these past six years.

26
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:51,156
This one's nice too.

27
00:01:51,180 --> 00:01:52,180
All the best.

28
00:01:55,430 --> 00:01:56,430
Mom,

29
00:01:56,510 --> 00:01:58,070
is today some special occasion?

30
00:01:58,350 --> 00:01:59,510
What occasion?

31
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,310
It's the wedding anniversary of me and your dad.

32
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,310
Hello.

33
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,726
The number you've dialed is not in service.

34
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:10,590
Please check the number and try again.

35
00:02:15,510 --> 00:02:16,256
What's wrong?

36
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,320
Is anything bothering you?

37
00:02:17,830 --> 00:02:18,830
Nothing.

38
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:19,600
Say,

39
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:22,070
when are you arranging for us

40
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,550
to meet Shang Zhitao?

41
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:28,480
She's from Harbin, isn't she?

42
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,416
How about we fly to Harbin

43
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:32,856
and meet her parents

44
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:34,440
during the Chinese New Year?

45
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,326
Once we've met,

46
00:02:36,350 --> 00:02:38,606
we can get the wedding arrangements underway.

47
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:40,550
We've broken up.

48
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,207
What?

49
00:02:42,231 --> 00:02:43,576
I told you.

50
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,630
It's all messed up.

51
00:02:47,230 --> 00:02:48,670
Don't listen to your dad.

52
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:49,920
Nian,

53
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:52,606
is it because you're moving to the US for work,

54
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:53,830
and she isn't happy with that?

55
00:02:54,510 --> 00:02:55,510
No.

56
00:02:55,550 --> 00:02:56,550
Don't worry about it.

57
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:58,440
Silly boy,

58
00:02:58,950 --> 00:03:01,480
be nicer to her.

59
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,920
Don't be so grouchy.

60
00:03:04,390 --> 00:03:05,456
If I remember correctly,

61
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:07,230
you've been together for years.

62
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,766
You have to cherish her.

63
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:10,920
Do you understand, Nian?

64
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,480
I know.

65
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:23,606
[Episode 22]

66
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:25,500
[The Number You Have Dialed Is Not in Service]

67
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:46,950
Luke.

68
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,256
Weren't you leaving for the US?

69
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,176
When do you fly?

70
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,200
Where's your mentee?

71
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,320
She resigned.

72
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,720
Resigned?

73
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,320
How does it look?

74
00:04:04,390 --> 00:04:06,000
Flora sold it to me for half price.

75
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,016
She was selling all her designer bags

76
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,830
at the company's flea market.

77
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:11,880
She never said where she was going.

78
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,280
She changed her number.

79
00:04:13,630 --> 00:04:15,280
She only said she'd get in touch someday.

80
00:04:29,670 --> 00:04:30,750
I want to know

81
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:33,056
why no one reported

82
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,480
a key employee's resignation to me.

83
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,287
You're talking about.

84
00:04:36,311 --> 00:04:37,326
Flora's resignation.

85
00:04:37,350 --> 00:04:38,167
I just want to know

86
00:04:38,191 --> 00:04:39,706
why the key employee's resignation

87
00:04:39,730 --> 00:04:40,770
never came across my desk.

88
00:04:44,790 --> 00:04:46,190
You made the rules.

89
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:49,640
Anyone below Specialist level only needs approval from the department head.

90
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,550
Flora wasn't a Specialist.

91
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,160
Besides,

92
00:04:53,870 --> 00:04:55,310
you're transferring to the US.

93
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:56,640
HR in China

94
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,840
isn't your responsibility anymore.

95
00:05:03,230 --> 00:05:04,870
You knew about us.

96
00:05:05,110 --> 00:05:06,406
Shouldn't you have told me?

97
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:08,430
I tried to convince her to stay.

98
00:05:08,790 --> 00:05:09,507
But she told me

99
00:05:09,531 --> 00:05:10,546
there was nothing between you anymore.

100
00:05:10,570 --> 00:05:11,177
So tell me,

101
00:05:11,201 --> 00:05:12,681
what position was I supposed to take?

102
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,430
This suicide video

103
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,040
has been making the rounds.

104
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:40,480
They say the man jumped because the pressure became too much.

105
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,600
This person

106
00:05:42,670 --> 00:05:44,280
seems to be Flora's friend.

107
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:59,156
Sun Yu and I

108
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:00,620
are catching a midnight movie later.

109
00:06:01,430 --> 00:06:02,550
Is Sun Yuanzhu not going?

110
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,696
I lost my best friend.

111
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,870
I lost the competition I should've won.

112
00:06:17,350 --> 00:06:18,640
What's the victim's name?

113
00:06:19,550 --> 00:06:21,150
Out of respect for the victim's privacy,

114
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,230
they didn't release the name.

115
00:06:24,230 --> 00:06:25,310
I heard

116
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:26,870
the surname was Sun.

117
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,160
Where's Shang Zhitao?

118
00:06:55,350 --> 00:06:56,350
She left.

119
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:58,456
She left quickly

120
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,520
and decisively.

121
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,840
She even changed her phone number.

122
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:03,727
But she said

123
00:07:03,751 --> 00:07:05,160
she'd get in touch with me later.

124
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,600
Help me find someone.

125
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,520
Shang Zhitao.

126
00:07:21,110 --> 00:07:22,990
She quit Lime without a word.

127
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:30,820
♪ Science and philosophy, the steps to solve the puzzles ♪

128
00:07:31,020 --> 00:07:34,140
♪ Names and places, this entire world too ♪

129
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:38,700
♪ Let them all slip away, then let time itself fade away ♪

130
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:45,060
♪ Rewrite every rule and old cliché ♪

131
00:07:45,500 --> 00:07:48,660
♪ Let vivid colors run free and tempt the eye ♪

132
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:53,060
♪ Build a brand-new Noah's Ark ♪

133
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:59,820
♪ Rewrite history, conventions, and moral codes... ♪

134
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,550
Shang Zhitao has probably decided to move back home.

135
00:08:10,780 --> 00:08:14,060
♪ Put rankings and comparisons aside ♪

136
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:17,700
♪ The soul's desires are just the tip of the iceberg ♪

137
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:22,220
♪ Be proud of yourself, just for being you... ♪

138
00:08:26,110 --> 00:08:27,190
You're an adult.

139
00:08:28,310 --> 00:08:29,310
If you say it's over,

140
00:08:30,670 --> 00:08:32,040
then don't ever start it again.

141
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,550
I never will.

142
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:39,260
♪ The world may change, but your stop hasn't come yet ♪

143
00:08:39,460 --> 00:08:42,900
♪ Time keeps changing, we are insignificant ♪

144
00:08:43,100 --> 00:08:46,580
♪ Enjoying this tiny, self-created universe... ♪

145
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:48,760
Luke.

146
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:54,300
♪ Open the world, face the lens of reality ♪

147
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:58,830
Grateful pup.

148
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:07,070
You should go with her.

149
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:51,860
[Harbin]

150
00:09:55,980 --> 00:09:59,016
[Old Couple's Tavern]

151
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,550
Slow down.

152
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:05,566
Mom said you were hopping around.

153
00:10:05,590 --> 00:10:07,240
Now look at you.

154
00:10:07,670 --> 00:10:09,246
Even young people

155
00:10:09,270 --> 00:10:11,110
need time to recover from an injury like this.

156
00:10:11,830 --> 00:10:13,790
A broken bone takes a hundred days.

157
00:10:13,830 --> 00:10:15,430
I'm in great shape.

158
00:10:15,790 --> 00:10:17,136
Other people need three to five months.

159
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,446
I'll be back on my feet in two months.

160
00:10:18,470 --> 00:10:20,040
Oh, stop bluffing.

161
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:21,976
He's so full of himself,

162
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,790
there's no cure for it.

163
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:26,240
Just pipe down.

164
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:28,246
You have to listen

165
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:29,550
to the doctor's advice.

166
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,000
I know.

167
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:39,430
Your mom said you're staying after Chinese New Year

168
00:10:40,190 --> 00:10:41,400
and finding a job in Harbin.

169
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:45,400
What happened in Beijing?

170
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,790
Weren't things going so well?

171
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,790
What's wrong?

172
00:10:52,190 --> 00:10:54,430
I can take care of your dad.

173
00:10:55,070 --> 00:10:56,830
You don't have to come home.

174
00:10:56,950 --> 00:10:58,430
You're young.

175
00:10:58,590 --> 00:11:00,790
This is when you should be out chasing your dreams.

176
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,336
Your dad's always bragging about

177
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,976
how amazing

178
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,686
his daughter is.

179
00:11:06,710 --> 00:11:09,136
That you're doing so well in Beijing.

180
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,446
We can't

181
00:11:10,470 --> 00:11:11,646
hold you back.

182
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:13,190
We've talked about it.

183
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:15,056
If we can't

184
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,760
keep the tavern running,

185
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:20,070
we'll just move into a retirement home.

186
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,336
Come on.

187
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,160
Why are you going to a retirement home?

188
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,407
I'm fine.

189
00:11:24,431 --> 00:11:25,670
Beijing was fine too.

190
00:11:26,430 --> 00:11:27,790
It's just that.

191
00:11:29,190 --> 00:11:31,016
I've moved from Harbin to Nanjing,

192
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,760
then Nanjing to Beijing.

193
00:11:37,190 --> 00:11:38,360
I'm tired.

194
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:40,737
I want to come home.

195
00:11:40,761 --> 00:11:42,016
I want to spend time with you two.

196
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:43,470
Aren't you happy I'm back?

197
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,520
I have my friends here.

198
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:48,120
My classmates are here. You two are here, too.

199
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:50,190
And my favorite snow.

200
00:11:52,430 --> 00:11:53,000
Alright.

201
00:11:53,310 --> 00:11:54,790
As long as you've thought it through.

202
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,240
My sweetheart is free to go wherever she wants

203
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,400
and do whatever she wants.

204
00:11:59,710 --> 00:12:01,000
You're always on my side, Dad.

205
00:12:01,710 --> 00:12:03,360
You're our only daughter.

206
00:12:03,590 --> 00:12:04,880
Who else would we love?

207
00:12:07,190 --> 00:12:08,920
Dad, Mom. Don't worry.

208
00:12:09,470 --> 00:12:11,190
I'll buy a little place here

209
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:13,160
and start my own business.

210
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:14,790
Have faith in me.

211
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:16,807
No matter where I am,

212
00:12:16,831 --> 00:12:18,280
I'll do just fine.

213
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:22,287
Of course.

214
00:12:22,311 --> 00:12:23,790
My girl's amazing.

215
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:25,760
Look at Mom.

216
00:12:26,310 --> 00:12:27,550
Look at her.

217
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:32,820
[Norway]

218
00:12:50,590 --> 00:12:52,190
It's my first time seeing him like this.

219
00:12:53,070 --> 00:12:54,550
He really fell hard for her.

220
00:12:56,310 --> 00:12:57,830
I figured that out long ago.

221
00:12:58,790 --> 00:13:00,400
Have you ever seen him

222
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:01,950
get into a fight over a woman?

223
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:05,240
He even flew back overnight from overseas on New Year's Eve

224
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:07,190
just to see Ms. Shang.

225
00:13:21,710 --> 00:13:22,830
Is that the aurora?

226
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:30,160
It is.

227
00:13:32,550 --> 00:13:33,550
It's beautiful.

228
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:37,920
Shang Zhitao.

229
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:41,280
Shall we go see the aurora next year?

230
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:42,550
Sure.

231
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,400
I'll go wherever you go.

232
00:14:03,190 --> 00:14:04,190
Luan Nian,

233
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:06,430
don't be sad.

234
00:14:06,950 --> 00:14:08,046
I want to praise you.

235
00:14:08,070 --> 00:14:09,310
I like you.

236
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:11,950
I like every path you've chosen.

237
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:14,070
I like going on adventures with you.

238
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,976
I like all the beautiful places we've seen.

239
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,640
Because I saw them with you.

240
00:14:21,020 --> 00:14:22,660
♪ Her smile, her kindness... ♪

241
00:14:24,590 --> 00:14:25,400
Hello.

242
00:14:25,470 --> 00:14:27,646
The number you've dialed is not in service.

243
00:14:27,670 --> 00:14:29,310
Please check the number and try again.

244
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:32,260
♪ She walked away, only tears remained ♪

245
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:36,740
♪ I can't describe, hear, or find... ♪

246
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,400
Shang Zhitao.

247
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,000
I'm watching the aurora.

248
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:44,920
Do you remember?

249
00:14:46,590 --> 00:14:48,036
We said we'd see them together.

250
00:14:48,060 --> 00:14:49,300
♪ Her fear, her pain... ♪

251
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,400
But you disappeared.

252
00:14:54,180 --> 00:14:55,820
♪ I care, I understand... ♪

253
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,000
It's okay.

254
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:02,550
I'll share them with you.

255
00:15:03,830 --> 00:15:05,280
You have to come see them someday.

256
00:15:06,430 --> 00:15:07,556
They're really beautiful.

257
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:10,740
♪ Promises became a burden after all that hesitation ♪

258
00:15:10,860 --> 00:15:13,740
♪ Leaving longing frozen into a winter night... ♪

259
00:15:14,310 --> 00:15:15,310
I'm sorry.

260
00:15:19,670 --> 00:15:20,796
I'm so sorry.

261
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:23,356
♪ The light's still on, but you're already far away... ♪

262
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:25,070
There are so many things I'm sorry for.

263
00:15:26,470 --> 00:15:28,120
I know I'm a mess.

264
00:15:30,470 --> 00:15:31,590
I don't deserve to be loved.

265
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,920
I just wanted to tell you,

266
00:15:39,590 --> 00:15:40,590
I miss you.

267
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:43,760
I miss you so much.

268
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:49,920
I love you.

269
00:15:51,070 --> 00:15:52,710
I love you.

270
00:15:58,070 --> 00:15:58,880
Hello.

271
00:15:58,950 --> 00:16:01,136
The number you've dialed is not in service.

272
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:03,040
Please check the number and try again.

273
00:16:07,580 --> 00:16:09,340
♪ Her fear, her pain ♪

274
00:16:09,420 --> 00:16:12,340
♪ Her dreams, the way she pulls away ♪

275
00:16:14,020 --> 00:16:15,820
♪ I care, I understand ♪

276
00:16:15,940 --> 00:16:18,780
♪ Why are we left in such a mess? ♪

277
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:23,406
♪ Can't hold on, can't forget, can't let go... ♪

278
00:16:23,430 --> 00:16:24,430
Luke,

279
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:25,806
what's the point of calling a dead number

280
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:26,830
over and over?

281
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:30,280
If you miss her, care about her,

282
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,190
go find her.

283
00:16:33,310 --> 00:16:34,550
Book a flight.

284
00:16:36,430 --> 00:16:36,927
She threw away

285
00:16:36,951 --> 00:16:38,710
everything that had to do with me.

286
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:42,550
Forget it.

287
00:16:43,590 --> 00:16:44,117
Let's go get some sleep.

288
00:16:44,141 --> 00:16:46,660
♪ Even a sunny day feels mediocre ♪

289
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:52,500
♪ That girl, my girl ♪

290
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:57,020
♪ If only one can win in love ♪

291
00:16:57,340 --> 00:16:59,860
♪ I am willing to lose to you ♪

292
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,670
Maybe

293
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,950
when I broke up with Xin Zhaozhou,

294
00:18:48,190 --> 00:18:49,320
I was too young.

295
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,576
Back then,

296
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:53,160
I could let go easily.

297
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:55,320
But this time,

298
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,270
I finally understood

299
00:18:57,510 --> 00:18:59,400
what it means to be cut by a dull knife.

300
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:01,640
The breakup itself

301
00:19:02,560 --> 00:19:03,560
was quick

302
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:05,160
and clean.

303
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:09,080
But once it sank in,

304
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,836
I'd think of him at most ordinary moments.

305
00:19:11,860 --> 00:19:15,540
♪ That you only see clearly up close ♪

306
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:20,460
♪ A non-committal relationship is just a waste ♪

307
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:25,100
♪ Love is a misunderstanding ♪

308
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:27,380
♪ A sudden intimacy ♪

309
00:19:27,420 --> 00:19:29,220
♪ That bugs you in secret ♪

310
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:30,820
♪ The more you try to take it back ♪

311
00:19:30,860 --> 00:19:33,140
♪ The more you try to deny it ♪

312
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:35,220
♪ The more you are being untruthful to yourself... ♪

313
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:36,840
And suddenly,

314
00:19:37,430 --> 00:19:38,430
my heart

315
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:40,160
would feel empty.

316
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:48,136
♪ I only dare chase an embrace I know I'll miss... ♪

317
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:51,560
A balloon in hand, happiness in my heart.

318
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:55,230
Balloons for sale!

319
00:19:55,950 --> 00:19:57,430
Tough balloons that won't pop easily.

320
00:20:02,740 --> 00:20:07,660
♪ A love that barely hurts could never compare ♪

321
00:20:08,860 --> 00:20:13,260
♪ Let it weigh on my mind until the very end ♪

322
00:20:14,140 --> 00:20:19,140
♪ Like the sudden lurch forward when the brakes are slammed ♪

323
00:20:20,220 --> 00:20:24,500
♪ And it's already too late for me to turn back ♪

324
00:20:25,140 --> 00:20:26,380
♪ Love is a cliff ♪

325
00:20:26,460 --> 00:20:30,700
♪ You know it's wrong, yet you don't turn back anyway ♪

326
00:20:30,780 --> 00:20:34,460
♪ You are sober, but I want to stay under your spell ♪

327
00:20:34,540 --> 00:20:36,420
♪ This intense flavor ♪

328
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:40,140
♪ Love is tears, and the more they overflow, the sadder it becomes ♪

329
00:20:40,220 --> 00:20:44,420
♪ Once the rainy season passes, I'll decide who to forget ♪

330
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:50,020
♪ And no one knows what's true or false ♪

331
00:21:14,670 --> 00:21:15,430
Hello?

332
00:21:15,670 --> 00:21:16,430
Ms. Shang.

333
00:21:16,670 --> 00:21:18,800
Your company registration has been completed.

334
00:21:20,230 --> 00:21:21,230
Alright.

335
00:21:38,990 --> 00:21:40,750
I'd like to try a hiring experiment.

336
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,576
I don't need you to have a lot of experience.

337
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:44,160
As long as you're willing to work hard

338
00:21:44,360 --> 00:21:45,360
and fight alongside me.

339
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:47,136
We'll probably be traveling a lot.

340
00:21:47,160 --> 00:21:48,007
It won't be easy.

341
00:21:48,031 --> 00:21:49,510
How does

342
00:21:49,750 --> 00:21:50,750
7,000 a month sound?

343
00:21:51,320 --> 00:21:53,950
7,000? I'd love that.

344
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:55,247
Boss.

345
00:21:55,271 --> 00:21:56,510
You're my boss from now on.

346
00:21:57,190 --> 00:21:59,376
Why don't I start today?

347
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:01,006
I've got nothing to do if I go home anyway.

348
00:22:01,030 --> 00:22:02,800
Looking forward to it, Fu Dong.

349
00:22:02,950 --> 00:22:03,950
Likewise.

350
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:05,576
Alright. Got it.

351
00:22:05,600 --> 00:22:06,600
Boss.

352
00:22:06,670 --> 00:22:07,670
Okay.

353
00:22:08,030 --> 00:22:09,206
I bought the car.

354
00:22:09,230 --> 00:22:10,856
Here's the key,

355
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:12,686
the transfer papers, and the inspection report.

356
00:22:12,710 --> 00:22:14,246
It's second-hand,

357
00:22:14,270 --> 00:22:15,656
but I think it'll last us

358
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:16,680
another three years.

359
00:22:16,750 --> 00:22:17,577
By then,

360
00:22:17,601 --> 00:22:19,406
you can drive, and I'll ride shotgun.

361
00:22:19,430 --> 00:22:20,920
We'll take on the world together.

362
00:22:21,360 --> 00:22:22,990
Why am I the one driving?

363
00:22:23,990 --> 00:22:24,990
I don't have a license.

364
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,030
I'll get one soon.

365
00:22:57,460 --> 00:22:59,636
[Qingtao Creative Event Studio]

366
00:22:59,660 --> 00:23:07,660
[Founder Shang Zhitao: Six Years at Lime Advertising, Beijing]

367
00:23:35,190 --> 00:23:35,880
Take care.

368
00:23:36,030 --> 00:23:37,190
Take care, Mr. Liu.

369
00:23:40,470 --> 00:23:42,360
Another deal done.

370
00:23:42,670 --> 00:23:44,536
Boss, how do you know everything?

371
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:45,750
You're so cool.

372
00:23:46,510 --> 00:23:47,800
It's New Year's Eve.

373
00:23:47,840 --> 00:23:49,406
A few of the new hires and I

374
00:23:49,430 --> 00:23:50,097
are getting together tonight.

375
00:23:50,121 --> 00:23:52,246
Want to join us?

376
00:23:52,270 --> 00:23:53,486
You guys pick whatever you want to eat.

377
00:23:53,510 --> 00:23:54,920
Bring me the receipt later.

378
00:23:55,560 --> 00:23:57,430
You're the best, Boss!

379
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:00,160
Come on. Go check it out.

380
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:01,470
Go on.

381
00:24:01,670 --> 00:24:02,670
Pick something good.

382
00:24:19,340 --> 00:24:20,996
[Recipient: Flora Shang]

383
00:24:21,020 --> 00:24:23,020
[Happy New Year. Wishing you all the best.]

384
00:24:25,020 --> 00:24:26,196
[Recipient: Flora Shang]

385
00:24:26,220 --> 00:24:28,020
[Happy New Year. Wishing you all the best.]

386
00:24:28,260 --> 00:24:32,140
♪ Whatever remains will be the proof ♪

387
00:24:35,500 --> 00:24:38,940
♪ If it never crosses your mind ♪

388
00:24:39,060 --> 00:24:42,620
♪ The tide as I turn back ♪

389
00:24:42,740 --> 00:24:46,660
♪ Is just formless attraction... ♪

390
00:24:52,470 --> 00:24:55,600
A balloon in hand, happiness in my heart.

391
00:24:58,320 --> 00:25:00,190
Balloons for sale!

392
00:25:00,800 --> 00:25:01,247
Balloons!

393
00:25:01,271 --> 00:25:02,920
Mister, I'd like one balloon.

394
00:25:03,430 --> 00:25:04,430
Here you go.

395
00:25:07,340 --> 00:25:11,500
♪ I would rather forget myself ♪

396
00:25:11,740 --> 00:25:15,740
♪ Just this moment ♪

397
00:25:31,980 --> 00:25:37,020
♪ Your aloofness masks your vulnerability ♪

398
00:25:39,100 --> 00:25:44,300
♪ I hide my nervousness in the corner ♪

399
00:25:46,140 --> 00:25:50,180
♪ Too many hurdles in this world ♪

400
00:25:50,260 --> 00:25:54,220
♪ Even one moment can keep us warm ♪

401
00:25:54,860 --> 00:25:58,900
♪ Just this moment ♪

402
00:26:01,420 --> 00:26:04,060
♪ All right? ♪

403
00:26:39,710 --> 00:26:40,800
Sun Yu.

404
00:26:45,030 --> 00:26:46,030
Are you better now?

405
00:26:48,360 --> 00:26:49,360
I am.

406
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:51,160
Let me give you an update.

407
00:26:51,560 --> 00:26:52,337
I bought

408
00:26:52,361 --> 00:26:53,686
a place.

409
00:26:53,710 --> 00:26:54,950
Just finished renovating it.

410
00:26:55,430 --> 00:26:57,270
I had

411
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,950
a huge bookshelf

412
00:27:00,880 --> 00:27:02,990
and put all the books Sun Yuanzhu gave me on it.

413
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:05,510
Oh, right.

414
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:07,840
I also started an event planning company.

415
00:27:08,030 --> 00:27:09,640
I've got a few employees.

416
00:27:10,030 --> 00:27:11,230
An event planning company?

417
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:12,687
I'll have our marketing manager

418
00:27:12,711 --> 00:27:14,080
contact you.

419
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:16,056
We need new suppliers

420
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:17,856
for some offline events

421
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:19,800
in your province.

422
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:22,160
Sounds good.

423
00:27:23,230 --> 00:27:24,560
So,

424
00:27:26,190 --> 00:27:28,800
do you want to come visit me in Harbin?

425
00:27:29,670 --> 00:27:30,400
Sure.

426
00:27:30,600 --> 00:27:31,750
Works for me.

427
00:27:50,470 --> 00:27:51,470
Lumi,

428
00:27:51,670 --> 00:27:52,670
it's me.

429
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:55,576
Want to come to Harbin for a few days?

430
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:56,646
Send me the address.

431
00:27:56,670 --> 00:27:58,350
I'll head over in the next couple of days.

432
00:28:17,020 --> 00:28:18,036
[I'm in high spirits.]

433
00:28:18,060 --> 00:28:19,536
[I came home wearing a happy smile.]

434
00:28:19,560 --> 00:28:20,860
[Sun Yuanzhu, reread in 2016]

435
00:28:58,140 --> 00:29:01,116
[Those Who Left, Those Who Stayed]

436
00:29:01,140 --> 00:29:03,006
[Old Couple's Tavern]

437
00:29:03,030 --> 00:29:04,230
My last boss

438
00:29:04,510 --> 00:29:05,840
was always saying,

439
00:29:06,320 --> 00:29:07,810
"Fudong,

440
00:29:08,030 --> 00:29:09,030
you're so sloppy."

441
00:29:10,120 --> 00:29:11,306
I'm sloppy?

442
00:29:11,330 --> 00:29:12,336
His business

443
00:29:12,360 --> 00:29:14,056
wasn't worthy of my talents.

444
00:29:14,080 --> 00:29:16,230
It was all office politics.

445
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:20,190
But after joining Boss Tao,

446
00:29:20,360 --> 00:29:21,966
I finally understood

447
00:29:21,990 --> 00:29:23,080
what

448
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:25,880
world-class ad planning looks like.

449
00:29:26,270 --> 00:29:27,576
None of our clients

450
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:28,670
has been dissatisfied with

451
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:31,360
any of my boss's proposals.

452
00:29:32,230 --> 00:29:33,230
Of course,

453
00:29:34,230 --> 00:29:35,336
I know

454
00:29:35,360 --> 00:29:37,726
I'm still lacking.

455
00:29:37,750 --> 00:29:39,600
After all, I don't have much experience.

456
00:29:39,640 --> 00:29:41,400
But you know what my boss always says?

457
00:29:42,190 --> 00:29:43,950
"I'm not afraid you don't know.

458
00:29:44,360 --> 00:29:46,430
I'm only afraid you won't learn."

459
00:29:47,030 --> 00:29:48,470
Come on. Here's to my boss.

460
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:50,230
Keep it up, young man.

461
00:29:53,430 --> 00:29:54,137
Now that's the right attitude.

462
00:29:54,161 --> 00:29:55,750
Shang Zhitao has really grown.

463
00:29:56,990 --> 00:29:57,990
Brother-in-law!

464
00:29:58,320 --> 00:29:59,136
What are you doing here?

465
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:00,160
You're here too?

466
00:30:00,270 --> 00:30:01,710
I brought some colleagues for lunch.

467
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:02,920
We'll head over first.

468
00:30:03,560 --> 00:30:04,710
What brings you here?

469
00:30:04,920 --> 00:30:05,990
Not busy today?

470
00:30:06,750 --> 00:30:07,727
You're here too.

471
00:30:07,751 --> 00:30:09,030
Let me introduce you.

472
00:30:09,950 --> 00:30:11,710
This is my best friend from Beijing.

473
00:30:11,990 --> 00:30:12,800
Xing Yi.

474
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:13,536
This is Lumi.

475
00:30:13,560 --> 00:30:13,990
Nice to meet you.

476
00:30:14,080 --> 00:30:14,576
Nice to meet you too.

477
00:30:14,600 --> 00:30:15,207
I'm Xing Yi.

478
00:30:15,231 --> 00:30:16,951
I looked after her when she was in Beijing.

479
00:30:18,400 --> 00:30:19,430
Go ahead and eat.

480
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:20,646
I'll check on my colleagues.

481
00:30:20,670 --> 00:30:21,400
Sure. Go ahead.

482
00:30:21,470 --> 00:30:22,470
Okay.

483
00:30:26,640 --> 00:30:27,446
Brother-in-law?

484
00:30:27,470 --> 00:30:28,470
What does that mean?

485
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:30,160
My middle school classmate.

486
00:30:31,030 --> 00:30:32,600
Fu Dong just calls him that

487
00:30:32,660 --> 00:30:33,700
to act like they're close.

488
00:30:35,800 --> 00:30:36,727
Xing Yi.

489
00:30:36,751 --> 00:30:37,840
Mr. Xing.

490
00:30:38,470 --> 00:30:39,840
He's a big shot around here.

491
00:30:41,840 --> 00:30:43,160
Long story short,

492
00:30:43,320 --> 00:30:45,096
he has introduced us

493
00:30:45,120 --> 00:30:46,776
to a lot of great suppliers.

494
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:49,400
He's taken really good care of my boss

495
00:30:49,660 --> 00:30:50,750
I mean, my boss's tavern.

496
00:30:52,030 --> 00:30:53,190
He's just teasing.

497
00:30:53,990 --> 00:30:56,360
I have to head back to Beijing later.

498
00:30:56,750 --> 00:30:57,750
Don't miss me too much.

499
00:30:57,950 --> 00:30:58,270
Come on.

500
00:30:58,360 --> 00:30:59,360
Fill my glass.

501
00:30:59,510 --> 00:31:00,510
Since I'm here

502
00:31:00,670 --> 00:31:02,686
in the great Northeast,

503
00:31:02,710 --> 00:31:04,726
let's raise a toast to Boss Shang.

504
00:31:04,750 --> 00:31:05,750
And to.

505
00:31:06,510 --> 00:31:07,120
Xing

506
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:08,120
Mr. Xing.

507
00:31:08,190 --> 00:31:09,057
A toast to Mr. Xing.

508
00:31:09,081 --> 00:31:10,166
Cheers.

509
00:31:10,190 --> 00:31:11,640
- To Mr. Xing.
- Cheers.

510
00:31:11,670 --> 00:31:12,407
Come on.

511
00:31:12,431 --> 00:31:13,600
Why are you drinking tea?

512
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:15,166
I'm driving later. Can't drink.

513
00:31:15,190 --> 00:31:15,896
I'll drink tea instead.

514
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:16,407
Come on.

515
00:31:16,431 --> 00:31:18,146
Let's drink till we drop.

516
00:31:18,170 --> 00:31:19,170
No problem.

517
00:31:27,950 --> 00:31:28,336
Alright.

518
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:29,360
I'd better get going.

519
00:31:29,670 --> 00:31:31,560
Text me next time.

520
00:31:31,640 --> 00:31:32,617
I'll take you out for dinner sometime.

521
00:31:32,641 --> 00:31:34,206
Just the two of us.

522
00:31:34,230 --> 00:31:35,230
Okay.

523
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:36,446
Don't come out. It's chilly.

524
00:31:36,470 --> 00:31:37,510
Bye.

525
00:31:41,670 --> 00:31:42,576
Why did you come down, Mom?

526
00:31:42,600 --> 00:31:43,800
I can clean everything myself.

527
00:31:49,160 --> 00:31:51,640
What's going on

528
00:31:52,400 --> 00:31:53,686
between you and Xing Yi?

529
00:31:53,710 --> 00:31:54,430
Hold your horses.

530
00:31:54,670 --> 00:31:55,617
Don't start imagining things.

531
00:31:55,641 --> 00:31:57,081
We've known each other for too long.

532
00:31:58,400 --> 00:31:59,400
Look at you.

533
00:32:00,080 --> 00:32:00,670
Well,

534
00:32:01,080 --> 00:32:02,246
you're not

535
00:32:02,270 --> 00:32:03,710
getting any younger.

536
00:32:04,190 --> 00:32:05,896
If things aren't happening with Xing Yi,

537
00:32:05,920 --> 00:32:07,136
you're going on blind dates

538
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:08,920
starting tomorrow.

539
00:32:10,230 --> 00:32:11,230
Mom.

540
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:13,577
Do you only think I'm doing well

541
00:32:13,601 --> 00:32:15,030
if I get married?

542
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:18,920
That's not what I mean.

543
00:32:19,840 --> 00:32:21,056
I just mean

544
00:32:21,080 --> 00:32:23,406
you haven't gotten over

545
00:32:23,430 --> 00:32:24,950
your last relationship.

546
00:32:25,750 --> 00:32:27,190
I read online

547
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:29,896
that the best way to get over an old relationship

548
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:32,120
is to start a new one.

549
00:32:32,600 --> 00:32:33,600
Right?

550
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:34,686
No matter what,

551
00:32:34,710 --> 00:32:36,926
whether it was good or bad, you've broken up.

552
00:32:36,950 --> 00:32:38,726
Now you have to

553
00:32:38,750 --> 00:32:40,246
keep loving life

554
00:32:40,270 --> 00:32:42,296
and love the person who deserves your love.

555
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:43,320
Don't you think?

556
00:32:45,080 --> 00:32:47,056
I just don't like blind dates.

557
00:32:47,080 --> 00:32:48,990
It has nothing to do with him.

558
00:32:49,840 --> 00:32:52,096
Love is all about fate.

559
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:52,857
Maybe I'll get married.

560
00:32:52,881 --> 00:32:54,270
Maybe I won't.

561
00:32:54,670 --> 00:32:55,816
For now,

562
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:57,186
I just want to get to know someone slowly

563
00:32:57,210 --> 00:32:58,710
and let things happen naturally.

564
00:32:58,920 --> 00:32:59,990
Does that sound okay?

565
00:33:03,360 --> 00:33:04,360
Okay.

566
00:33:04,710 --> 00:33:06,686
Then your dad and I will save up a little more for you.

567
00:33:06,710 --> 00:33:07,166
Alright?

568
00:33:07,190 --> 00:33:07,600
Alright.

569
00:33:08,030 --> 00:33:09,080
We'll save together.

570
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:12,950
Leave them. I'll carry them.

571
00:33:27,190 --> 00:33:28,190
Come in.

572
00:33:30,030 --> 00:33:31,030
Boss,

573
00:33:31,190 --> 00:33:32,600
I heard you're back.

574
00:33:33,470 --> 00:33:34,630
I have something to tell you.

575
00:33:36,120 --> 00:33:37,120
Go on.

576
00:33:40,230 --> 00:33:41,710
I've got a project.

577
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:43,470
You might want to take a look.

578
00:33:43,950 --> 00:33:44,897
What kind of project

579
00:33:44,921 --> 00:33:45,950
needs my attention?

580
00:33:47,950 --> 00:33:49,160
Bring it to your boss, Will.

581
00:33:50,560 --> 00:33:51,560
Here's the thing.

582
00:33:52,030 --> 00:33:52,897
I've got

583
00:33:52,921 --> 00:33:53,926
an international summit

584
00:33:53,950 --> 00:33:54,950
for a beer brand.

585
00:33:54,990 --> 00:33:56,510
They want an offline event.

586
00:33:56,750 --> 00:33:59,160
I picked Harbin,

587
00:33:59,950 --> 00:34:01,160
but Will is against it.

588
00:34:01,360 --> 00:34:02,576
I think.

589
00:34:02,600 --> 00:34:04,726
Harbin has huge potential.

590
00:34:04,750 --> 00:34:05,750
It's worth investing in.

591
00:34:08,430 --> 00:34:09,720
I printed out

592
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:10,840
the supplier rankings.

593
00:34:11,110 --> 00:34:12,320
I think the top one

594
00:34:12,590 --> 00:34:14,720
deserves a closer look.

595
00:34:19,980 --> 00:34:22,980
[Shang Zhitao]

596
00:34:33,200 --> 00:34:34,200
Leave the list here.

597
00:34:34,630 --> 00:34:35,630
I'll look at it myself.

598
00:34:36,470 --> 00:34:37,470
You got it.

599
00:34:38,030 --> 00:34:39,030
Lumi.

600
00:34:40,240 --> 00:34:41,240
I'm in on this project

601
00:34:41,680 --> 00:34:42,800
from start to finish.

602
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:44,360
You bet.

603
00:35:03,200 --> 00:35:04,526
Lumi, long time no see.

604
00:35:04,550 --> 00:35:05,830
- Fu Dong.
- You've lost weight.

605
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:11,256
This is our boss,

606
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:12,280
Luke.

607
00:35:13,470 --> 00:35:14,760
Hello, Mr. Luan.

608
00:35:15,150 --> 00:35:17,296
I'm Ms. Shang's assistant.

609
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:18,320
My name is Fu Dong.

610
00:35:21,430 --> 00:35:22,430
Where's Ms. Shang?

611
00:35:22,550 --> 00:35:24,176
The summit is around the corner.

612
00:35:24,200 --> 00:35:25,816
She's been working around the clock these past few days.

613
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:27,696
She insists on handling a lot of things herself.

614
00:35:27,720 --> 00:35:30,110
She's probably at the venue now.

615
00:35:30,590 --> 00:35:32,280
When can we see her?

616
00:35:33,590 --> 00:35:35,656
I'll give her a call and see.

617
00:35:35,680 --> 00:35:36,217
Give me a minute.

618
00:35:36,241 --> 00:35:37,590
Why don't we check into the hotel

619
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:38,407
and get some rest in the meantime?

620
00:35:38,431 --> 00:35:39,496
If you need anything during your stay,

621
00:35:39,520 --> 00:35:40,520
just let me know.

622
00:35:41,150 --> 00:35:42,150
Alright.

623
00:35:50,630 --> 00:35:51,630
Lumi.

624
00:35:51,950 --> 00:35:53,950
What's the plan for tomorrow?

625
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,336
Everything is set.

626
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:57,776
I also arranged a few local media outlets.

627
00:35:57,800 --> 00:35:59,920
Think of it as my gift to you.

628
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:00,720
By the way,

629
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:02,966
the day after is all arranged too.

630
00:36:02,990 --> 00:36:04,790
I'll go over everything again tomorrow night.

631
00:36:05,150 --> 00:36:06,920
Come see me when you're done.

632
00:36:07,630 --> 00:36:08,816
I can't meet with you today.

633
00:36:08,840 --> 00:36:09,950
Go enjoy yourself.

634
00:36:10,430 --> 00:36:11,257
Tomorrow,

635
00:36:11,281 --> 00:36:12,800
I'll give Lime

636
00:36:12,880 --> 00:36:15,150
the most elegant and luxurious summit.

637
00:36:15,990 --> 00:36:16,990
I believe you.

638
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:20,840
She's not coming.

639
00:37:18,900 --> 00:37:20,700
♪ Her fear, her pain ♪

640
00:37:20,780 --> 00:37:23,660
♪ Her dreams, the way she pulls away ♪

641
00:37:25,380 --> 00:37:27,180
♪ I care, I understand ♪

642
00:37:27,220 --> 00:37:30,100
♪ Why are we left in such a mess? ♪

643
00:37:32,060 --> 00:37:34,900
♪ Can't hold on, can't forget, can't let go ♪

644
00:37:34,940 --> 00:37:36,780
♪ Of her all-or-nothing love ♪

645
00:37:38,780 --> 00:37:41,900
♪ Promises became a burden after all that hesitation ♪

646
00:37:42,260 --> 00:37:45,100
♪ Leaving longing frozen into a winter night ♪

647
00:37:45,540 --> 00:37:50,380
♪ That girl, my girl ♪

648
00:37:52,060 --> 00:37:55,140
♪ If my future doesn't lead me to you... ♪

649
00:37:56,950 --> 00:37:57,950
Tao.

650
00:37:58,680 --> 00:37:59,680
Lumi.

651
00:37:59,720 --> 00:38:00,720
Great work.

652
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:04,486
I was watching the rehearsal for quite a while just now.

653
00:38:04,510 --> 00:38:05,800
Where's the host?

654
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,110
I'm the host.

655
00:38:08,680 --> 00:38:09,680
Stop kidding.

656
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,840
I'm not kidding. I'm the host.

657
00:38:13,200 --> 00:38:14,336
It's an international summit,

658
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:16,216
broadcast live across five countries

659
00:38:16,240 --> 00:38:17,177
in three languages.

660
00:38:17,201 --> 00:38:18,240
Can you handle that?

661
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:20,216
That's exactly why.

662
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:22,486
Hiring someone from Beijing would've cost me twenty thousand.

663
00:38:22,510 --> 00:38:24,046
I figured I might as well do it myself.

664
00:38:24,070 --> 00:38:24,880
I can save the money.

665
00:38:25,070 --> 00:38:25,897
I'm telling you,

666
00:38:25,921 --> 00:38:27,566
I wanted this summit to be held in Harbin.

667
00:38:27,590 --> 00:38:28,736
Those are all my biggest clients.

668
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:29,926
Don't embarrass me.

669
00:38:29,950 --> 00:38:31,400
Have faith in me, okay?

670
00:38:31,470 --> 00:38:32,216
Really?

671
00:38:32,240 --> 00:38:33,240
Of course.

672
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:35,110
I've got to get ready.

673
00:38:46,630 --> 00:38:47,630
Long time no see.

674
00:39:07,580 --> 00:39:08,980
♪ Love is a misunderstanding ♪

675
00:39:09,020 --> 00:39:11,220
♪ A sudden intimacy ♪

676
00:39:11,260 --> 00:39:13,100
♪ That bugs you in secret ♪

677
00:39:13,180 --> 00:39:14,660
♪ The more you try to take it back ♪

678
00:39:14,740 --> 00:39:17,020
♪ The more you try to deny it ♪

679
00:39:17,100 --> 00:39:19,060
♪ The more you are being untruthful to yourself ♪

680
00:39:19,100 --> 00:39:20,420
♪ Who should I love again? ♪

681
00:39:20,460 --> 00:39:22,740
♪ I don't want to get hurt in the end ♪

682
00:39:22,780 --> 00:39:27,100
♪ A love with too much devotion is against the rules ♪

683
00:39:27,220 --> 00:39:32,500
♪ I only dare chase an embrace I know I'll miss ♪

684
00:39:54,590 --> 00:39:55,590
Boss.

685
00:39:55,950 --> 00:39:58,566
Lime's Mr. Luan wants an iced Americano.

686
00:39:58,590 --> 00:40:00,320
We only have hot coffee.

687
00:40:00,510 --> 00:40:01,736
The event's about to start.

688
00:40:01,760 --> 00:40:03,656
Where are we supposed to get an iced Americano now?

689
00:40:03,680 --> 00:40:04,990
He's pretty demanding.

690
00:40:05,550 --> 00:40:06,296
What should I do then?

691
00:40:06,320 --> 00:40:07,110
How do we deal with him?

692
00:40:07,240 --> 00:40:08,470
It's too late to buy one.

693
00:40:08,680 --> 00:40:10,480
Just apologize and tell him we don't have it.

694
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:12,760
Will that work?

695
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:13,840
Didn't you always say

696
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:15,046
we should meet

697
00:40:15,070 --> 00:40:16,606
every client request?

698
00:40:16,630 --> 00:40:18,750
Knowing when to say no to unreasonable client demands

699
00:40:18,950 --> 00:40:20,510
is also part of your job.

700
00:40:25,860 --> 00:40:29,046
[International Beer Industry Summit]

701
00:40:29,070 --> 00:40:30,070
Good afternoon,

702
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:31,280
friends.

703
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:33,070
The northern land is covered in snow,

704
00:40:33,470 --> 00:40:34,920
but the heart burns with warmth.

705
00:40:35,720 --> 00:40:37,720
Good afternoon, everyone.

706
00:40:37,940 --> 00:40:39,700
Northern land is covered in snow,

707
00:40:40,180 --> 00:40:42,790
but the heart is filled with warmth.

708
00:40:43,760 --> 00:40:46,606
Good afternoon, friends.

709
00:40:46,630 --> 00:40:49,446
Northern land is covered in snow,

710
00:40:49,470 --> 00:40:51,720
but the heart is filled with warmth.

711
00:40:53,590 --> 00:40:55,320
Lime thanks everyone for joining us

712
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:58,200
in this ice and snow adventure.

713
00:40:58,680 --> 00:41:01,140
Lime thanks everyone for joining us

714
00:41:01,380 --> 00:41:03,940
in this ice and snow adventure.

715
00:41:05,300 --> 00:41:07,916
Lime thanks everyone for joining us

716
00:41:07,940 --> 00:41:12,180
in this ice and snow adventure.

717
00:41:18,070 --> 00:41:19,007
Welcome to Harbin.

718
00:41:19,031 --> 00:41:20,470
Xing Yi, what are you doing here?

719
00:41:20,760 --> 00:41:22,470
Tao asked me to help out.

720
00:41:22,990 --> 00:41:24,750
The owner of this hotel is a friend of mine.

721
00:41:34,500 --> 00:41:37,860
[International Beer Industry Summit]

722
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:45,030
I study English every weekend.

723
00:41:45,200 --> 00:41:46,200
I have to keep learning

724
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:48,360
so I can be worthy of being part of Lime.

725
00:42:18,760 --> 00:42:19,840
As expected of my mentee.

726
00:42:20,550 --> 00:42:21,550
She's a genius.

727
00:42:24,470 --> 00:42:25,840
She's not just a genius.

728
00:42:27,510 --> 00:42:29,390
She's also the hardest-working person I've met.

729
00:42:33,510 --> 00:42:35,296
Now, please welcome.

730
00:42:35,320 --> 00:42:37,760
Lime's Global Senior President, Luke,

731
00:42:38,030 --> 00:42:39,310
to the stage to say a few words.

732
00:43:37,400 --> 00:43:38,400
You did a good job.

733
00:43:38,630 --> 00:43:40,526
Don't tell me you've learned Italian too.

734
00:43:40,550 --> 00:43:41,880
Stop teasing me.

735
00:43:41,950 --> 00:43:43,550
Was it that bad?

736
00:43:43,840 --> 00:43:44,856
It was great.

737
00:43:44,880 --> 00:43:45,526
You scared me, though.

738
00:43:45,550 --> 00:43:46,550
Tao.

739
00:43:46,920 --> 00:43:47,920
Drink your medicine.

740
00:43:48,760 --> 00:43:49,470
Thanks.

741
00:43:49,550 --> 00:43:50,896
Why are you taking Chinese medicine?

742
00:43:50,920 --> 00:43:52,546
My hormones are a little out of balance.

743
00:43:52,570 --> 00:43:53,926
I'm trying to get them back on track.

744
00:43:53,950 --> 00:43:55,320
Get some rest.

745
00:43:55,630 --> 00:43:56,527
Once everything wraps up here,

746
00:43:56,551 --> 00:43:57,720
let's go grab some barbecue.

747
00:44:01,150 --> 00:44:01,896
We'll talk later.

748
00:44:01,920 --> 00:44:02,527
I've got to go.

749
00:44:02,551 --> 00:44:03,566
You... But he...

750
00:44:03,590 --> 00:44:04,590
- You...
- Let's go.

751
00:44:12,470 --> 00:44:13,470
Mr. Xing.

752
00:44:14,630 --> 00:44:15,510
Are you leaving?

753
00:44:15,550 --> 00:44:16,046
I apologize

754
00:44:16,070 --> 00:44:17,070
if I've missed anything.

755
00:44:17,550 --> 00:44:18,296
Aren't you cold?

756
00:44:18,320 --> 00:44:18,926
You're wearing so little.

757
00:44:18,950 --> 00:44:19,950
Not at all.

758
00:44:26,800 --> 00:44:28,510
Do you still love Shang Zhitao or not?

759
00:44:29,720 --> 00:44:31,590
Is that even the point anymore?

760
00:44:33,030 --> 00:44:34,790
Can't you see she's more ruthless than I am?

761
00:44:38,110 --> 00:44:39,736
Looks like Dong's boss is about to have a boyfriend.

762
00:44:39,760 --> 00:44:40,590
Apparently,

763
00:44:40,760 --> 00:44:42,480
my friend is about to have a boyfriend too.

764
00:44:42,630 --> 00:44:43,790
Do you have her home address?

765
00:44:44,630 --> 00:44:46,470
No, I don't have it.

766
00:44:46,920 --> 00:44:49,110
But I've already sent you

767
00:44:49,630 --> 00:44:51,360
the address of her parents' tavern.

768
00:44:55,030 --> 00:44:56,400
Do you know

769
00:44:57,200 --> 00:44:58,920
why you haven't been fired all these years?

770
00:44:59,280 --> 00:44:59,840
Why?

771
00:45:00,240 --> 00:45:01,240
Because you're smart.

772
00:45:03,070 --> 00:45:04,240
I'm more than just smart.

773
00:45:05,950 --> 00:45:07,270
If the mountain won't come to me,

774
00:45:07,360 --> 00:45:08,400
I'll go to the mountain.

775
00:45:11,630 --> 00:45:13,320
We should all keep learning.

776
00:45:13,990 --> 00:45:15,720
Learn English and French,

777
00:45:16,110 --> 00:45:16,680
and learn

778
00:45:17,110 --> 00:45:18,240
how to love.

779
00:45:24,020 --> 00:45:27,036
♪ One look is all it takes to find the right person ♪

780
00:45:27,060 --> 00:45:29,900
♪ One lifetime is all it takes to commemorate this love ♪

781
00:45:30,900 --> 00:45:34,860
♪ Whatever remains will be the proof ♪

782
00:45:38,140 --> 00:45:41,476
♪ If it never crosses your mind ♪

783
00:45:41,500 --> 00:45:45,196
♪ The tide as I turn back ♪

784
00:45:45,220 --> 00:45:49,540
♪ Is just formless attraction ♪

785
00:45:51,100 --> 00:45:56,420
♪ Your silhouette is closing in ♪

786
00:45:58,260 --> 00:46:03,860
♪ Your breathing grows clear ♪

787
00:46:05,420 --> 00:46:09,756
♪ Too many distractions in this world ♪

788
00:46:09,780 --> 00:46:14,500
♪ I would rather forget myself ♪

789
00:46:14,780 --> 00:46:18,940
♪ Just this moment ♪

790
00:46:19,580 --> 00:46:22,956
♪ One look is all it takes to find the right person ♪

791
00:46:22,980 --> 00:46:25,900
♪ One lifetime is all it takes to commemorate this love ♪

792
00:46:26,740 --> 00:46:30,940
♪ If you miss it, just save the traces ♪

793
00:46:33,900 --> 00:46:37,636
♪ If your tears fall on their own ♪

794
00:46:37,660 --> 00:46:40,980
♪ Followed by our hearts beating to the same rhythm ♪

795
00:46:41,100 --> 00:46:43,260
♪ Will you listen to it ♪

796
00:46:43,300 --> 00:46:47,380
♪ Or will you reply to me in silence? ♪

797
00:46:47,420 --> 00:46:52,340
♪ Your silhouette is closing in ♪

798
00:46:54,300 --> 00:47:00,500
♪ Your breathing grows clear ♪

799
00:47:01,300 --> 00:47:05,820
♪ Too many distractions in this world ♪

800
00:47:05,900 --> 00:47:10,540
♪ I would rather forget myself ♪

801
00:47:10,620 --> 00:47:15,580
♪ All I want is to lose myself in this moment ♪

802
00:47:15,900 --> 00:47:22,020
♪ Your aloofness masks your vulnerability ♪

803
00:47:22,940 --> 00:47:29,100
♪ I hide my nervousness in the corner ♪

804
00:47:30,180 --> 00:47:34,620
♪ Too many hurdles in this world ♪

805
00:47:34,660 --> 00:47:38,780
♪ Even one moment can keep us warm ♪

806
00:47:38,980 --> 00:47:44,780
♪ Just this moment ♪

807
00:47:45,380 --> 00:47:48,700
♪ All right? ♪
